CryptoSwift

FernletLock's scrypt comes from CryptoSwift, which is not covered by the
Apache License. Fernlet builds it from a fork,
https://github.com/bowman-mw/CryptoSwift, which alters one line of the
package manifest (the iOS deployment floor, marked in the file) and no
source file. The original is https://github.com/krzyzanowskim/CryptoSwift.
Its license is in App/Fernlet/Acknowledgments/CryptoSwift-LICENSE.txt,
unaltered, and the app bundle carries the same file. The app shows the
acknowledgment below and the whole license in Settings > Acknowledgments,
beside the fonts' notices, and fernlet.com/technical carries the
acknowledgment too.

